  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Quiet cool-white studio",
    "overview": "Chotu's web studio gives an idea room to become a video. Cool white surfaces, graphite reading text, and desaturated blue actions keep attention on the creator's words and reviewable artifacts. The user chose the clarity of ChatGPT and Gemini as the web reference; this is an independent visual system from native mobile.\n\nDM Sans carries the interface and conversation. Instrument Serif brings a human editorial note to the opening question and canvas introduction. Generous empty space, restrained borders, and modest surface changes keep the interface calm while imagery supplies the visual richness.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool white surfaces with graphite text and muted blue interactions.",
      "Spacious reading areas with compact supporting controls.",
      "Serif display moments surrounded by plain sans-serif UI.",
      "Flat conversation content, softly lifted composers, and clearly separated review surfaces."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use blue for actions, focus, selection, and a few display accents; keep continuous reading text graphite.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Voices Rule",
